{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"platforms":["iOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"+ (","kind":"text"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"text":"setEmails:","kind":"identifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"NSArray","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)NSArray"},{"kind":"text","text":" *) "},{"text":"emails","kind":"internalParam"},{"kind":"text","text":";"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"emails","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Array of email address strings. Each must be a valid email format.","type":"text"}]}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Associates multiple email addresses with the current device for omnichannel"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"email campaigns. This is useful when users have multiple email addresses"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(work, personal, etc.) and want to receive communications on all of them.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"All provided emails will be linked to the same device and user ID,"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"enabling unified targeting across all addresses.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Example","anchor":"Example","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Register multiple emails from user profile:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["class UserProfileManager {","","    func syncEmailsFromProfile(_ profile: UserProfile) {","        var emails: [String] = []","","        if let primary = profile.primaryEmail {","            emails.append(primary)","        }","        if let secondary = profile.secondaryEmail {","            emails.append(secondary)","        }","        if let work = profile.workEmail {","            emails.append(work)","        }","","        guard !emails.isEmpty else { return }","","        Pushwoosh.configure.setEmails(emails)","","        \/\/ Update tags with email count","        Pushwoosh.configure.setTags([","            \"email_count\": emails.count,","            \"has_work_email\": profile.workEmail != nil,","            \"has_multiple_emails\": emails.count > 1","        ])","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setemails:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"metadata":{"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)setEmails:","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"setEmails:","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"roleHeading":"Type Method","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"text":"setEmails:","kind":"identifier"}],"symbolKind":"method","title":"setEmails:"},"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"occ","url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setEmails:"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"patch":0,"minor":3},"kind":"symbol","sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Registers multiple email addresses associated with the current user."}],"references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/setEmails:":{"role":"symbol","title":"setEmails:","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"setEmails:"}],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/setemails:","abstract":[{"text":"Registers multiple email addresses associated with the current user.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/setEmails:","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"